# App environment (optional)

Copy to `.env.local` for live POP wallet + Supabase auth:

```bash
VITE_POP_VALIDATOR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
VITE_AUTO_SETTLE=true

# From `supabase status -o env` or `./scripts/dev_stack.sh`:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon-key>

# Fallback when auth not configured:
# VITE_DEMO_USER_ID=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

# Stripe (Phase 4 — functions promoted, keys deferred):
# VITE_STRIPE_FUNCTIONS_READY=true
# VITE_STRIPE_CHECKOUT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/create-checkout
```

When `VITE_POP_VALIDATOR_URL` is set:
- Loop 1 POSTs proof packets to the validator
- Wallet polls pending holds; auto-settle when `VITE_AUTO_SETTLE=true`

When `VITE_SUPABASE_*` is set:
- App auto signs in seeded demo user (`demo-user-001@i.local`)
- Settle uses real auth user id for ledger RPC

Demo credentials: see `app/supabase/seed.sql`
